assertion_line: 834
expression: help
---
Materialise every configured global view and project view in one shot

Usage: skillnet sync [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --apply-promote
          Promote view-side edits back into canonical skills
      --config <CONFIG>
          Path to the skillnet TOML configuration file [env: SKILLNET_CONFIG=]
      --mirror-root <MIRROR_ROOT>
          Root directory containing the global/ and projects/ mirror directories [env: SKILLNET_MIRROR_ROOT=]
      --no-promote
          Disable promotion handling and keep legacy non-symlink errors
      --catalog-config <CATALOG_CONFIG>
          Path to the skill catalog metadata configuration file [env: SKILLNET_CATALOG_CONFIG=]
      --force
          Destructively demote view-side content when canonical is newer
      --database-url <URL>
          Postgres URL for the calibration database
      --prefer <PREFER>
          Tie-breaker for equal-mtime or both-advanced conflicts [possible values: view, canonical]
      --adopt-new
          Adopt view-only skills into canonical when promotion is enabled
      --dry-run
          Print planned filesystem changes without mutating files
      --allow-delete
          Remove view entries that no longer correspond to canonical skills
      --allow-dirty-destination
          Allow mutating the mirror destination even when its Git working tree is dirty
  -h, --help
          Print help
